ead and was sacrificed to the  trench by the atlanteans together with  the trident and a huge army of sea  creatures they now face orm and his  hosts this time around aquaman wins but  spares the life of his half-brother  after he promises to support him upon  learning that his mother is still alive  in the end atlanta returns to artha's  father at the surface while arthur and  mera ascend to the throne  there are constantly fresh news about  the cast of course we know of many  familiar actors who will again play an  important role but also interesting new  ones are being announced over and over  again among them is someone who was  already considered a terror of the seas  in other series  it's a given that jason momoa will once  again take on the role of arthur curry  aka aquaman he was certainly partly  responsible for the success of the first  movie which clearly stood out from the  otherwise rather weak dc eu film  adaptions especially when you see the  portrayals of aquaman in the comics but  more makes a successful change he will  also be joined by amber hurt and the  role of mera she will surely have a lot  to do in order to help him out of some  of his troubles further confirmed is  nicole kidman as queen atlanta and star  wars star tamara morrison as thomas  curry what kind of importance their  roles will have however is not yet clear  else's half-brother orm known as ocean  master is also back he will of course be  played by patrick wilson again whether  he finds that aquaman's side as promised  or forges his own plans is something we  will probably only see on the big screen  we have also already seen a villain in  the mid-credit scene of the first part  namely aya abdul madin ii is david kane  better known as black manta likewise  returning as dolph lundgren as king  nerius the father of mira he had joined  orm for much of the first film but  switched sides when he saw aquaman with  the first king's trident atlan the king  of atlantis was previously introduced as  a character but has been recast he sang  the city thousands of years ago in an  accident went into exile afterwards in  the previous sequences he was played by  grey mctavish now however vincent regan  has taken over the part we doubt that he  will have a big role we rather suspect  for the flashbacks like in the first  part  as we could already see in the mid  credit scene there is a new villain  namely dr steven shin played by randall  park in the scene he pulls the half dead  david cain out of the sea when kane  wakes up he is already in shin's lap  shin demands to know where atlantis is  and promises black manta to help him  with his revenge in exchange for the  information this steven shin should not  be too unknown to the comic readers  among you in fact in the comics he's a  friend of arthur and his father however  it results in a break after the two are  unwilling to reveal anything about  atlantis to the scientist also to appear  is karshan the tiger shark which mutated  in an atomic explosion and is actually  considered an adversary of green lantern  how big the roll will be or whether the  villain is only being teased is  unfortunately not yet known the shark is  played by india moore who is known from  the us series pose  but arthur curry won't have to face all  the baddies alone a new hero will also  make his debut we are talking about  stingray who is a member of the light  brigade in the comics the new hero will  be played by yan xiao who is still  relatively unknown in hollywood the  portuguese actress has previously  appeared mostly in local productions are  the more reason to look forward to her  debut in hollywood and her new role in  the dc eu  however there's another newcomer we are  most excited about and that is none  other than euron greyjoy actor pilo  asbeck he has already sailed this season  game of thrones and is known there as a  notorious sailor he's one of the few  actors for whose role not even the name  is known however we hope to see him back  in his old manner namely as a scoundrel  and a womanizer he's already  demonstrated that this kind of role  really suits him  already shortly after the release of the  first part a second one was announced by  dc in january 2020 the release date was  set for december 2022 with james juan  and david leslie johnson writing the  script and directing as they did in the  first part even before filming began  there was a wild discussion about the  role of mera amber heard was alleged to  have falsified evidence in a trial with  johnny depp and as a result a petition  with 1.6 million signatures was  submitted that the road should be recast  one name that was read time and time  again was emilia clarke in the end  though the cast remained the same as in  the first movie with the beginning of  the pandemic the start of shooting for  aquaman the lost kingdom was also  delayed but the team still managed to  complete the film and the allotted time  so that so far at least the release date  has not been postponed the premiere is  expected to be on december 16 2022  unfortunately not much is known about  this storyline yet we are eagerly  waiting for the first trailer thus the  story we're describing is pure theory  and not confirmed by anyone based on the  title a possible plot can be put  together anyways as the title and the  lost kingdom already reveals it is about  well lost kingdom it might be possible  that this very kingdom is not atlantis  but some other kingdom perhaps dr steven  shin stumbled upon it during his  research on the underwater city and  discovered former enemies of atlantis  together with kane he could now go in  search of this civilization in order to  bring them back into a war with atlantis  p we aspect who could possibly leave the  alien kingdom might also play a major  role according to james 1 aquaman 2 is  supposed to be spookier again the last  kingdom could possibly be located in the  depth of the trench kingdom after all  t